cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AMMBA, please cite the publication given as preferred citation."
type: software
title: "AMMBA: Automated Market Maker for Batch Auctions"
abstract: >-
  AMMBA is an AMM-based trading mechanism for local energy communities. It
  clears each delivery slot against a community pool at one uniform price,
  given by a sigmoid function of the ratio between local supply and demand and
  bounded by the retail price and the feed-in tariff. The repository contains
  the clearing engine, an offline calibration tool for the pricing parameters,
  a settlement engine for the GSY Decentralised Energy Exchange, and an
  optional on-chain audit anchor. Developed in the Horizon Europe project
  INTELLIGENT (Grant Agreement No. 101160678).
authors:
  - name: "University of Cologne, INTELLIGENT project team"
version: 0.1.8 # x-release-please-version
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
